  "findings_zh": [
    "在 −0.8 m/s 指令下，同脚触地周期频率为 1.254 Hz，每周期后移 0.501 m，专家巡航估计为 0.630 m。足端在机身坐标系下的前后范围（P95 减 P05）为 24.5 cm，专家为 28.7 cm。",
    "同给 −0.8 m/s，最接近指令和偏差最大的各四个环境分别达到 -0.712 和 -0.545 m/s。前组每步加权任务回报多 0.00885，风格回报少 0.01324，混合后少 0.00439。−0.4 m/s 未出现同样的净反转。分组中同时存在物理参数差异，这个比较只能描述实测回报的取舍。",
    "原地 ±0.35 rad/s 时，每个同脚触地周期的机身航向变化为 +7.5°、-8.5°。专家每周期竖直轴转量约 +15.8°、-15.8°。两侧实测步频约 1.25 Hz。摆动中段的左右足前后位移差显示，策略和专家的双脚协同方式不同。",
    "固定 ±0.35 rad/s 指令，将对应专家与同向 ±0.15 rad/s 慢速专家的有效十帧窗配对。判别器把对应速度排在慢速前面的比例，左转为 52.9%，右转为 47.6%。用相同十帧的有符号偏航速度均值排序，两侧都超过 99.9%。−0.8 与 −0.6 m/s 倒退的判别器排序比例为 80.1%，对应加权风格回报每步只差 0.000226。",
    "冻结判别器，在真实高速倒退窗口中换入相近专家的纵向速度序列，原始判别分平均增加 0.013；换入专家的关节和足端通道，平均增加 0.955。拼接窗口仅用于检查网络对输入的响应。",
    "在原地 ±0.35 rad/s，跟踪较好的四个环境每步混合回报仍多 0.00269、0.00187，风格项缩小了这一优势。标称平面上倒退为 -0.695 m/s，原地两侧为 +0.101、-0.088 rad/s。移除随机化后仍有欠速。",
    "训练指令的 vx 和 wz 分别独立均匀采样，另有 2% 显式静站。按此配置，|vx|≤0.05 m/s 且 |wz|≥0.30 rad/s 的理论概率为 0.875%（左右合计）。前进和后退的采样范围对称，单凭该分布难以解释前后跟踪差距。",
    "按训练配置逐帧复算了实际速度跟踪奖励，线速度标准差 0.50，偏航 0.30。所有稳态移动用例中 stop_motion、stand_still 均为零。已复核专家网格命中、28 维 AMP 中的物理角速度、Actor 历史内的原始指令及原生动作重放。"
  ],
  "history_frames": 10,
  "limitations": "One checkpoint and one seed. Nominal removes multiple randomizations together. Physical yaw torques and effects of changing the training objective require independent interventions.",
  "method": {
    "actor": "Recorded pre-action histories [10,41] every tenth tick from 205 through 495. Check TorchScript against Native actions, then probe fixed histories changing only a command channel at all ten time positions. Compare leg targets scaled by 0.25 rad and wheel angular speeds; these are instantaneous inferences.",
    "contact": "Ground load >5 N, five-tick time median filter, successive same-foot touchdowns within ticks 200..499. Accept periods 0.6..1.04 s; raw/accepted counts included. Equal environment weighting. Cycle travel integrates heading-frame root COM vx. Both unwrapped world heading delta and integral of physical world omega_z reported. Reference per cycle uses cruise 10-frame expected speed × 0.8s. Foot x range is per-foot P95 minus P05 in body coordinates. Signed swing excursion measured between ascending and descending crossings of midpoint of foot z P10..P90; also checked at 35% and 65% of the range. This geometry does not independently measure ground yaw torque.",
    "features": "100 stable ticks with stride 3 × 16 environments. Nearest genuine expert window chosen by 10-frame distance in normalized joint position and body-frame foot position. Swap exact channel subsets at a fixed command; hybrids measure network sensitivity only. Probe that removes mean speed bias is separate.",
    "ranking": "All eligible post-windows at start indices 1..L−10 inclusive in each genuine cruise clip, or stand segment. AUC is fraction of all matched vs alternative pairs ranked in the right order (ties half). Speed-only readout uses the direction times mean measured vx or wz over the same 10 frames. Separate 40-frame results cover a full stride. Overlapping windows are not independent confidence samples.",
    "reward": "All 300 steady ticks × 16 environments. Weighted task rate from live reward manager × 0.3 × 0.02; weighted style = 0.7 × 2 × 0.02 × max(0,1−(D−1)^2/4). Frozen checkpoint uses normalized next ten-frame window and actual scaled command. Raw tracked speed reward terms exactly cross-checked. Speed-bias probes shift the single velocity axis to match the mean target while preserving fluctuations. Closest/farthest groups defined by absolute mean speed error within each scenario. These are replayed per-step rewards on observed deterministic trajectories, rather than PPO training advantage estimates.",
    "sampling": "Actual CPU CommandConditionedAMPLoader, 4096 draws per query, seed 42. Exact cells above deadband select their labeled clip. Raw command probabilities are theoretical under UniformVelocityCommand, not measured training visits."
  },
